{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4f67e3be35b477d490374677259fb8bf554fdfdcf2f90fdb8156bfeb8ac8d116", "ja": "（今日はあずささんと『アイグラ！！』の\n制服グラビア撮影の日だ）", "zh": "（今天要陪梓小姐拍摄\n《I‧G‧R‧A！！》的制服写真照。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "a1022d74d4fdddddf54cd9c793c95bc3cdad68f375eda8450ee14c91d22c9bf5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせしました。\n今日の撮影はこの部屋で、ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让你久等了。\n今天要在这个房间拍吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ef94a27939f966125e27312725bf7edb56a5bfcb98659156f63e9a6fc6b6ea2f", "ja": "はい。このオフィスを借りて、働く女性の自然な\n美しさ、というコンセプトで撮っていく感じです。", "zh": "嗯，我们租了这间办公室，\n拍摄的主题是职场女性的自然美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "026f15ca25fceae644765f8c2c37b3cbf7c1ae7777fd17a1e6ae57ae5c262be0", "ja": "素敵ですね♪　もしかして、そのコンセプトも\n{$P$}さんが……？", "zh": "听起来真棒呢♪该不会，这个概念也是\n{$P$}先生想的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8da326fd2bbe538a0458a644e4afc0a7b33070edfdfed05a5a80372b99b5e671", "ja": "ええ、考えました。あずささんがモデルですから、\n落ち着いた大人の女性としての美しさ、そして……。", "zh": "嗯，是我想的，因为模特儿是梓小姐，所以我希望\n能表现出沉着冷静的成熟女性之美，以及……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5e8e0c440f1b73ad0d7cdba75397b3e6ddd658f5df3c027099013547538c3e9a", "ja": "自然体で働く女性のかわいらしさ、なんかも\n見る人に伝えたいと思ってます。", "zh": "女性在职场上毫不做作的可爱，\n这些正是我想要传达给读者的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "5c14d557bd3cd93fbeb4da973476eef4f7723854ea9f238075e445a9779392d9", "ja": "ま、まあ。私で伝えられるといいんですけれど……。\nでは、ご期待に応えられるよう、がんばりますねっ。", "zh": "这、这样啊，希望我可以确实呈现出这些感觉……\n那么，我会努力不辜负你的期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "6b18ab86e2a7c33f6a0095c85af6c0535a25739f2a133e92ea24c683a66a6715", "ja": "そうだ。今の私って、{$P$}さんには\nどういう仕事をしている女性に見えますか？", "zh": "对了，现在的我啊，在{$P$}先生\n的眼里，看起来像是在从事什么工作的女性呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "bedee3bbe6920d016156b32373c1c8046239106b2801009f33245322c0333fd1", "ja": "撮影前に、私なりにイメージを膨らませておきたくて。\n教えてもらえると助かります～。", "zh": "我想在拍摄前先做一些想像。\n希望你能告诉我，帮我一个忙～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f88a016d9ad9157cbd2344cf04cac796f78ec2d80acedb39f90eb593d6170427", "ja": "そうですね……。どう見えるというか、あずささんに\n似合うのは、音無さんのような一般事務とか……", "zh": "这个嘛……梓小姐看起来像做什么的……\n我觉得适合你的有像音无小姐在做的一般事务人员……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1010_p", "source_sha256": "df304f2a98f577972a9d1c86687f15bd0db8a67c6d48a880363ad83cf21c9029", "ja": "受付とか秘書とかオペレーターとか、営業担当、\n通訳、広報……あ、キャリアウーマンもいいですね。", "zh": "柜台人员、秘书、话务员等等，还有业务负责人、\n口译、广告行销……啊，职业女性也不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "b3ed0830b550f0718c538b7ce3b21c536117dfbfd0e1fa4b4b7d2d6d3e2ac441", "ja": "え、ええっと～、音無さんにオペレーターに、通訳……\nす、すみません、もう一度いいですか？", "zh": "呃、呃～音无小姐、话务员还有口译……\n不、不好意思，可以麻烦你再说一次吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2be0d788cbedb83c0975c07b7828b11aba1868667855287da3408cff36d08e9d", "ja": "あ、すみません！　候補を減らしますね。\nとりあえず、1つ選ぶなら……。", "zh": "啊，抱歉！我先删掉一些选项。\n总之，要选一个的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_1013", "source_sha256": "0634cc2853b8ef9ffc0307af22bf0152b905c0f752a97e2742d3fc891a9b0f14", "ja": "受付", "zh": "柜台人员", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_2000_p", "source_sha256": "cdf9e514754611b75a71d3f0b75a72fef84077e9aec554c4c42cc30de9111968", "ja": "とりあえず、受付がいいと思います。", "zh": "总之，我觉得当柜台人员不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_2001_010azu", "source_sha256": "1093160261238a4a0f0bbf2b9796348fc74c1c188995eaf491f0d561b9d183d2", "ja": "受付ですね、わかりました！\nでも……、どうして受付なんですか？", "zh": "柜台人员呀，我明白了！\n不过……为什么是柜台人员呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_2002_p", "source_sha256": "b634b6e79a7d9cbf6a617ebc2724502c4dc2dde8482cc4a0fe98dbf9df202ff4", "ja": "まあ、あずささんの笑顔で出迎えてもらえたら、\nきっと誰でも嬉しくなりますから。", "zh": "这个嘛，因为要是能被梓小姐的笑容接待，\n我想不论是谁都会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_2003_010azu", "source_sha256": "5a8fe722d0ecb4ab85d52187ca4261d1fbcf7c3fedeb7861bd33636b066e05f8", "ja": "まあ！　{$P$}さんったら……。\nふふっ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "哎呀！{$P$}先生真会说话……\n呵呵，谢谢夸奖♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_2004_010azu", "source_sha256": "bce95892116be8446a97e2c143d1b720630cd9774f51ed37f8592fc9a7767896", "ja": "お出迎え……。\nそうですね、大切なお客さまを、笑顔で……。", "zh": "接待……\n说得也是，用笑容迎接重要的客人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_2005_010azu", "source_sha256": "c8a2e619d0d76fa418bda4793c68343fa2e887523b1ab5522685aca80716ea64", "ja": "はっ。もしかして、お仕事帰りの旦那さまを、\n玄関で迎えるような感じでも……？", "zh": "啊，在玄关迎接下班回家的老公，\n说不定也是这种感觉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_2006_p", "source_sha256": "d218990aa3bc7d7ca882e25dc54d04c1ba3c081e1c8f4b6725054660d2da4fa6", "ja": "……あずささん？", "zh": "……梓小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_2007_010azu", "source_sha256": "e2e49dfbbce4ba94933f279ae296c2b5502d2e1c4dbcb49bf5eb3a135ccb4730", "ja": "素敵なイメージが膨らんできました。あの……\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "我的脑中浮现很棒的想像了。\n那个……非常谢谢你，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_2008_p", "source_sha256": "ada27fbbe58a05d2d5cf20677a6431e1900338d46d5b407aaab9d3295d41c6ba", "ja": "いえいえ、役に立てたのならよかったです。\n撮影も上手くいきそうですね！", "zh": "哪里哪里，有帮上忙就好。\n看来拍摄也会很顺利呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_2009_010azu", "source_sha256": "f4aa6aa2a43343c24b798445a1b411a78f87a1344b943d322d3905a137878e9d", "ja": "はい。\nえっと……。お帰りなさい♪", "zh": "嗯。\n那个……欢迎回来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0113_2010_010azu", "source_sha256": "891003be06b8f56554a56403b0fc2c781bd7e2cfd7f138eeaf77fd0001b694ac", "ja": "あ、今のはお仕事の練習です！　ちょっと試してみて、\nその……な、何でもありませんから～！", "zh": "啊，我刚刚是为了工作在练习！稍微试一下，\n那个……你、你什么都没听到啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
